# {{lb|en|obsolete|rare}} An [[act#Noun|act]] of [[present#Verb|presenting]] a thing to someone or something, especially as a [[gift#Noun|gift]] or an [[honour#Noun|honour]]; a [[bestowal]].
#: {{synonyms|en|bestowing|bestowment}}
#* {{RQ:Warner Albions England|edition=5th|chapter=XXVII|page=134|passage=The [[w:Muses|Muſes]] bacely begge, or bibbe, or both, and muſt, for vvhy? / They finde as bad '''Beſtoe''' as is their Portage beggerly: / Yea novv by melancholie vvalkes and thred-bare coates vve geſſe / At Clyents and at Poetes: none vvorke more and profit leſſe, {{...}}}}

